{
  "about": "Warden's entry types: what an entry of a space can be beyond a plain event, the fields each carries and the vocabulary packs that offer it. The server checks entries against these (mcp-go/warden.go), the page builds its Add menu and forms from them (apps/spaces) and an assistant reads them with list_entry_types. kind: event (on the calendar, a date), deadline (a day something is due, with a reminder), record (kept in a list; a date or a date range is optional). Field types: text, longtext, date, time, number, money (euros), bool, choice (one of options), ward (a ward's id), person (a name), phone, email, url, months.",
